# 🛡️ Defend Your Experience – AI Career Intelligence (Day 50)

An AI-powered adaptive interview defense simulator that helps professionals confidently defend every claim on their resume, portfolio, LinkedIn profile, or project documentation.

Built as part of the **ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge – Day 50**.

## 🚀 Overview

Traditional interview preparation focuses on answering common questions.

**Defend Your Experience** goes a step further.

Instead of asking generic interview questions, the application extracts meaningful claims from your uploaded experience and continuously challenges you with personalized follow-up questions, just like an experienced interviewer.

The goal is to help users:

* Defend every achievement with confidence
* Identify weak or unsupported claims
* Improve storytelling skills
* Prepare for difficult recruiter and hiring manager questions
* Build interview confidence through adaptive practice

