## 🎯 How It Works

1. Upload your resume, LinkedIn profile, portfolio, or project.
2. AI extracts every meaningful claim.
3. The interview begins.
4. Each answer generates deeper, personalized follow-up questions.
5. Weak areas are identified automatically.
6. Receive a comprehensive Defense Report with actionable recommendations.

